WEBVTT

NOTE Caption timings follow the original 2.0.0 production timeline.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850 line:12%
[Upbeat instrumental music]
You finally convinced your girlfriend
to try Stremio.

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.950 line:12%
Or your boyfriend. We don't judge.

00:00:05.451 --> 00:00:06.840 line:12%
They pressed the down button once.

00:00:06.951 --> 00:00:08.990 line:12%
And the TV took a moment
to reflect on its life.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.140 line:12%
Two minutes later,
they're back on Netflix.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.550 line:12%
And honestly? Fair.

00:00:13.099 --> 00:00:16.550 line:12%
Because on our TV,
Stremio and Nuvio feel laggy.

00:00:16.739 --> 00:00:19.640 line:12%
Nuvio's TV app is 169,000 lines
of JavaScript,

00:00:19.659 --> 00:00:22.000 line:12%
inside a web browser,
inside your television.

00:00:22.677 --> 00:00:24.200 line:12%
Better Stremio has no browser.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:27.490 line:12%
25,000 lines of C, talking straight
to the graphics chip.

00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:29.100 line:12%
It's built on Stremio Origin.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:30.960 line:12%
And then we took
some very heavy inspiration

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.850 line:12%
from everything your partner
likes about Netflix.

00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:35.800 line:12%
A giant billboard,
with the movie already playing.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.270 line:12%
Rest on a card, it opens wide

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.550 line:12%
and plays the actual film,
past the boring credits.

00:00:41.195 --> 00:00:44.610 line:12%
Top 10, with the big numbers,
because humans love a leaderboard.

00:00:45.024 --> 00:00:48.440 line:12%
Because You Watched, worked out on your
own TV, not in somebody's cloud.

00:00:48.853 --> 00:00:50.450 line:12%
One press picks the best stream.

00:00:50.653 --> 00:00:51.820 line:12%
Skip intro. Skip recap.

00:00:51.913 --> 00:00:53.650 line:12%
Subtitles that actually sync.
Dolby Vision.

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.030 line:12%
And [bleep] DTS,
converted right on the TV.

00:00:56.512 --> 00:00:59.550 line:12%
20 accent colours, for the person who
needs the app to match the couch.

00:01:00.341 --> 00:01:03.190 line:12%
LG TVs. Android TV. Google TV.

00:01:03.401 --> 00:01:05.840 line:12%
Fire TV. Phones.
Free and open source.

00:01:06.136 --> 00:01:08.350 line:12%
Nuvio, we borrowed your P2P engine.

00:01:08.496 --> 00:01:10.590 line:12%
Thank you. We love you. Still laggy.

00:01:11.189 --> 00:01:14.030 line:12%
Better Stremio. Bring your own addons.
Keep your relationship.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.360 line:12%
[Music fades out]
